          "level": 1,
          "html": "Provenance &amp; Crypto",
          "align": "center",
          "size": null
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "html": "An ongoing archival and provenance layer for Little Martians. Core videos and texts are stored on decentralized systems (IPFS / Arweave) and anchored on-chain — a permanent, timestamped record of what was made, when, and by whom. This is an evolving effort: I'm gradually moving more of the work into reliable, decentralized storage, building a lasting record of authorship in an age of synthetic media.",
          "align": null,
          "size": null
        },
