                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Christie’s ‘Augmented Intelligence’",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "First major auction solely dedicated to AI art.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Augmented Intelligence is a groundbreaking auction highlighting the breadth and quality of AI Art. The sale includes remarkable works from some of the most innovative minds — from early AI pioneers of the 1960s such as Harold Cohen to contemporary artists",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "The auction redefines the evolution of art and technology, exploring human agency in the age of AI within fine art. From robotics to GANs to interactive experiences, artists incorporate and collaborate with artificial intelligence in a variety of mediums including paintings, sculptures, prints, digital art and more. Collectors will have the opportunity to experience a truly captivating exhibition at Rockefeller Center for the duration of the online sale, 20 February – 5 March 2025",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
